    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Gear Mong Kok</strong> is a fast-paced action game that combines hack-and-slash with shooting mechanics. Unleash stylish combos and take on uniquely designed enemies\u2014beat them to a pulp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/163f622ee4a4cd54df45c7216af7d9dd.poster.avif?t=1753965392\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/163f622ee4a4cd54df45c7216af7d9dd.webm?t=1753965392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/163f622ee4a4cd54df45c7216af7d9dd.mp4?t=1753965392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future Hong Kong taken over by rogue machines after an alien fortress invasion, Kate is frustrated that she can't buy cigarettes. Armed with her transformable high-tech weapon, &quot;Double Cigarettes,&quot; and her cigarette-box-shaped mechanical assistant, she fights back against the alien stronghold!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth Action Combat -\u00a0</strong>Unleash stylish ground and aerial combos on your enemies!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialized Bullets -</strong> Each with unique effects to take down enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A diverse variety of skill combinations!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge massive bosses in epic battles!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/6365096ae180bcd45551914c94661e48.poster.avif?t=1753965392\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/6365096ae180bcd45551914c94661e48.webm?t=1753965392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/6365096ae180bcd45551914c94661e48.mp4?t=1753965392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
