play muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/6365096ae180bcd45551914c94661e48.poster.avif?t=1753965392\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/6365096ae180bcd45551914c94661e48.webm?t=1753965392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539360/extras/6365096ae180bcd45551914c94661e48.mp4?t=1753965392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
